sequenceDiagram
  participant Agent as Agent / Unix Tool
  participant Mount as ChronosFS FUSE Mount
  participant FS as NativeChronosFS
  participant Store as NativeBranchStore
  participant Meta as Metadata Store
  participant Data as ChronosFS Interval Tables

  Agent->>Mount: mkdir .chronos/branches/agent
  Mount->>FS: create_branch("agent", current_branch)
  FS->>Store: create_branch("agent", current_branch)
  Store->>Meta: allocate branch metadata

  Agent->>Mount: write .chronos/current = "agent"
  Mount->>FS: checkout mount to agent
  FS->>Store: checkout("agent")

  Agent->>Mount: POSIX write /src/solution.py
  Mount->>FS: write_inode_at(inode, offset, bytes)
  FS->>Store: upsert chronosfs_file_blocks
  Store->>Data: interval splice block rows

  Agent->>Mount: cat .chronos/merge-preview/agent..main.json
  Mount->>FS: merge_preview_json(agent, main)
  FS->>Store: merge_preview(agent, main)
  Store->>Data: compare base/source/target rows
  FS-->>Agent: JSON conflicts by path + byte_range

  Agent->>Mount: write .chronos/merge-apply/agent..main JSON
  Mount->>FS: apply policy/resolution
  FS->>Store: apply_merge_changes(agent, main)
  Store->>Meta: reserve merge + continuation
  Store->>Data: write accepted rows into merge segment
  Store->>Meta: publish continuation as main head
